Opaque reference and inline bounds

```
[x][m]
*[m]: y
.
<p>[x][m]</p>
```

```
![x][m]
*[m]: y
.
<p>![x][m]</p>
```

```
see [m] here
*[m]: y
.
<p>see [<abbr title="y">m</abbr>] here</p>
```

```
|\|	
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>|</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
{+`{#+}#}
.
<p>{+<code>{#+}#}</code></p>
```

```
_*x
/*b*/
.
<p>_<strong>x
/*b</strong>/</p>
```

```
>  
.
<blockquote><p> </p></blockquote>
```

```
>  
.
<blockquote><p> </p></blockquote>
```

```
$$`x
^ p
.
<figure>
  <p><span class="math display" role="math">\[x\]</span></p>
  <figcaption>p</figcaption>
</figure>
```
